          "command": "cross bridge",
          "response": "The bridge creaks as you cross it, but it's solid.\n\nEdge Of Meadow\nThe grasses are fragrant under the sunshine of a brilliant summer morning. A \nstream chatters by at your feet, and a weathered old wooden bridge stretches \nacross it to the east. Beyond the stream, your hillside stretches upward.\n\nYou hear the noise of your group off to the west! Half of them seem to be \nsetting up for the volleyball finals; the others are building the campfires \nthat will burn tonight.\n\n>",
