          "command": "wait",
          "response": "Time passes.\n\nRobert \"Tasty\" Tasker, overbearing pizza guy and mafia don extraordinaire, \nkeeps talking. \"After you fouled up the escape of our front man, I figured that \nbomb would have done you in. But it looks like I'm going to have to finish you \nmyself, since I just can't rely on incompetent employees anymore.\" \n\nAnother tremor shakes the building. You notice a hairline crack opening up in \nthe floor.\n\n>",
