          "command": "hit floor",
          "response": "(the floor)\nYou beat on the floor with your fists. It doesn't help.\n\n\"Think of this as a favor, Stan,\" says Mr. Tasty as he reaches into his coat \npocket. \"You're a terminal loser. If I didn't conclude your pitiful little life \nthis way, you'd never have amounted to anything anyway. Maybe you'll get your \nname in the papers now.\"\n\nOutside, you hear the police shouting on the bullhorn. \"WE HAVE GIVEN YOU FAIR \nWARNING. WE ARE NOW COMING UP TO GET YOU.\"\n\n>",
